he acute angle between $x$ and ${\\text{proj}}_{S}x$ or any other non-zero vector that is parallel to ${\\text{proj}}_{S}x.$ \n\nComputing the cosine using the dot product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{x\\cdot {\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x}{‖x‖\\,‖{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\cdot 5+1\\cdot 0+3\\cdot 1+1\\cdot (-1)}{\\sqrt{{5}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}+{1}^{2}}\\sqrt{{5}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{\\sqrt{36}\\sqrt{27}} \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{6\\cdot 3\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})=\\frac{\\pi }{6},\n$$\n\nwhich is already an acute angle." 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309458 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309459 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309460 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309461 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309462 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1041 "selection" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1104 #edb/ref 17592186309462 13194139534775 true] [17592186309457 1110 #uuid "3d6bea67-d5f4-5664-859b-bd9e4a8a8d97" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309458 1034 "\\frac{2\\pi }{5}" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309458 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534775 true] [17592186309458 1111 #uuid "7f808610-b7e8-56f4-af93-cc794fb8f85f" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309459 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309459 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534775 true] [17592186309459 1111 #uuid "4b7673a1-7656-52e5-b18e-02ccad4619f9" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309460 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" 13194139534775 true] [17592186309460 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534775 true] [17592186309460 1111 #uuid "940ef9bc-57fc-5858-a0d8-37f54a7c839c" 13194139534775 true] [175921863